# Live household database. Never track a SQLite file with its -wal / -shm:
# a committed sidecar can resurrect deleted rows or corrupt the database.
.hq-household/*.sqlite
.hq-household/*.sqlite-shm
.hq-household/*.sqlite-wal
.hq-household/culinia_self.json
.hq-household/culinia_thread.json
